# .NET / C# — OFFLINE FALLBACK ONLY
# Primary source: `dotnet new gitignore` (same as Visual Studio — always current with SDK)
# This file is used only when the dotnet CLI is unavailable during setup-init.
# Added once by setup-init — edit freely, not managed or overwritten by gitignore-sync.

